Pe dată de 2010-12-14 15:42, Kogut a scris:
> On 14 Gru, 12:43, David Damerell <damer...@chiark.greenend.org.uk> wrote:
>> Derek Ray, Pasi Kallinen, and Patric Mueller are taking effective action.
